      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "While you can surprisingly find a lot of items around your home to make-shift a Self Tape on the fly. It is wise to invest in some Essential Equipment that you can rely on to assist in producing great, professional looking self tapes. This gear will make the Actor look good, sound great and should pop out to a Casting Director."
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "And it doesn&#39;t have to cost you a small fortune! For under $150 you can get an arsenal of necessities in Self Tape Gear. At the end of this section there is a shopping guide with links to some of the best prices on Amazon for items mentioned."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/courses/perfect-self-tape/equipment-guide/images/37d6e47b-3b36-4945-8d3d-9f82f9217c64.jpg",
          "width": 2560,
          "height": 1920
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "html": "Video Recording Device",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "It is up to you which route you want to take in capturing video. Do not feel like you have to use a prosumer DSLR camera if that is not in the budget."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
