      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "Softboxes are the trusty standard in Video Lighting. They produce a soft filtered light. This light is even and pleasing to skin tones."
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "Softboxes are relatively inexpensive and very lightweight."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/courses/perfect-self-tape/equipment-guide/images/cb7b9969-5b7e-4fcd-8264-3be7d1dc24be.jpg",
          "width": 1200,
          "height": 431
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "They come in Square, Rectangle and Octagon Shapes."
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "Most commonly for Self Tapes a 20&quot; - 28&quot; rectangle softbox is used."
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "label": "Softbox Article",
          "href": "https://www.karltayloreducation.com/lighting-modifiers-softboxes/",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "video",
          "provider": "youtube",
          "id": "Oum3SuOsAN4",
          "align": "left"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "full-width",
      "classes": [
        "full-width-section"
      ],
      "spacing": {
        "top": "normal",
        "bottom": "normal"
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/courses/perfect-self-tape/equipment-guide/images/0040ab79-4ad8-476e-83e8-3e951e812691.jpg",
          "width": 750,
          "height": 500
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "single-column",
      "classes": [
        "single-column-section",
        "large-content-spacing-top",
        "large-content-spacing-bottom"
      ],
      "spacing": {
        "top": "large",
        "bottom": "large"
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "html": "Ring Light",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "Ring Lights have increased in popularity the last few years. Consumer Ring Light production has given affordable options to those wanting the beauty enhancing qualities of light."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/courses/perfect-self-tape/equipment-guide/images/57ee883c-a7a2-423f-94c7-2fc7f08a94db.jpg",
          "width": 500,
          "height": 666
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "Ring Lights come in sizes from 6&quot; to 24&quot; or above. Most common for Self Tapes is a 18&quot; Ring Light."
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "Ring Lights are Bi-Color meaning they can adjust from Warm Light to Cool Light. They also have variable intensity of brightness."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/courses/perfect-self-tape/equipment-guide/images/1400f23f-a844-4849-b64c-565cd99c015c.jpg",
          "width": 1426,
          "height": 1495
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "html": "Ring Lights are best used for your MAIN LIGHT."
        },
        {
          "type": "video",
          "provider": "youtube",
          "id": "K4wsrW0VpLE",
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "html": "LED",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "Video production loves the use of LED lights because they are low energy and last several times longer than traditional light bulbs."
        }
      ]
    },
