      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "Keeping your video from shaking is the easiest and first step to creating a quality Self Tape.",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "html": "You need a Tripod!",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/courses/perfect-self-tape/equipment-guide/images/e760334d-add2-415e-bab8-654ab8ed3f33.jpg",
          "width": 334,
          "height": 501
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "A standard tripod between 50&quot; and 70&quot; is ideal for Self Tape Videos"
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "You will need separate mounts for your tripod if you are using a Tablet or Smartphone as your recording device."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/courses/perfect-self-tape/equipment-guide/images/4786b21a-46b7-467d-a2ab-b60dc91e4dc5.jpg",
          "width": 1450,
          "height": 1318,
          "caption": "Tablet Mount"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/courses/perfect-self-tape/equipment-guide/images/f457469a-6453-4c75-bea9-ac0fd3a87dff.jpg",
          "width": 1282,
          "height": 1500,
          "caption": "Smartphone Mount"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
