      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "Bad sound is the number one killer of amateur video.",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "html": "A Microphone is an easy fix to many Self Tape Woes.",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "A Lavalier or &quot;Lapel&quot; Mic is easily adaptable to use with Smartphones, Cameras and Tablets."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/courses/perfect-self-tape/equipment-guide/images/3befde9d-4afc-4722-9177-2a2f44766548.jpg",
          "width": 1000,
          "height": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "They come with long enough cords to not be confining."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/courses/perfect-self-tape/equipment-guide/images/5e320e03-551c-471a-ac68-48693526c402.jpg",
          "width": 844,
          "height": 1000
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "The lapel mic will focus the sound on the Actor and lessen the volume from The Reader, who is usually operating the camera."
        },
        {
          "type": "video",
          "provider": "youtube",
          "id": "hoj_uDLJpm4",
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/courses/perfect-self-tape/equipment-guide/images/b8bb7643-89f9-4a35-8aa1-dbe04f7525d6.jpg",
          "width": 958,
          "height": 1172
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "Since Lapel mics have a 3.5mm Audio connection. You will most likely need an adapter to use it with an Iphone or Ipad."
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "They make simple adapters for Lightning and C-Type"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/courses/perfect-self-tape/equipment-guide/images/d85fc850-43d7-438e-ae31-86fac44b3c2c.jpg",
          "width": 340,
          "height": 489
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "html": "BACKDROPS",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "It is perfectly acceptable to use a plain wall in your home or even an Unwrinkled sheet.",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "You will find the Self Tapes that look really polished have a backdrop that compliments the Actor in a pleasing color.",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "Shades of Grey, Blue, Green, Brown are popular choices.",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/courses/perfect-self-tape/equipment-guide/images/8A9F7F54-FBA9-4BFC-825F-6F14F899AD70.png",
          "width": 2560,
          "height": 2560
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "Popup shades are easily transportable and create a Self Tape studio wherever you are.",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/courses/perfect-self-tape/equipment-guide/images/6271E3C0-645C-4873-B16D-E01DB5468A13.jpg",
          "width": 450,
          "height": 450
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "Our go-to backdrop is a Grey Wool blanket that adds texture and does not reflect hot light.",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/courses/perfect-self-tape/equipment-guide/images/D5B032B8-B9D6-4BF5-9D1B-E1AC68D0D230.jpg",
          "width": 1500,
          "height": 1500
        }
      ]
    },
